1
00:00:11,360 --> 00:00:17,540
Toward the sunset
floating on the Naka River,

2
00:00:18,060 --> 00:00:24,660
when I kick a pebble, even my shoes fly off.

3
00:00:25,680 --> 00:00:32,880
onto the head of the
carpenter I was messing with,

4
00:00:32,880 --> 00:00:39,120
they laughed, saying I'm still just a kid.

5
00:00:39,760 --> 00:00:44,240
Even if I've left my energy somewhere,

6
00:00:44,240 --> 00:00:47,460
pachinko, sighs, and yawns,
all part of the routine.

7
00:00:47,460 --> 00:00:53,180
The unused streets somehow
feel strangely gentle.

8
00:00:54,660 --> 00:01:01,240
From the pointed-hat canteen,

9
00:01:01,860 --> 00:01:07,460
the big power lines and the setting sun.

10
00:01:11,660 --> 00:01:15,920
Tomorrow too,
it'll end just like this, won't it?

11
00:01:15,920 --> 00:01:21,060
In Katsushika, Shibamata,
again, even happiness gets lost.

12
00:01:21,060 --> 00:01:24,520
Because I'm a fool who only
realized after hearing it.

13
00:01:29,040 --> 00:01:31,180
Bookshelf, sword, one pull, one shot.

14
00:01:37,820 --> 00:01:40,040
Damn! It's a fog!

15
00:01:41,960 --> 00:01:43,280
Hey, that's dangerous!

16
00:01:44,940 --> 00:01:46,480
What's wrong, Ryo-chan?

17
00:01:46,900 --> 00:01:47,120
Yeah.

18
00:01:51,060 --> 00:01:54,260
Hey! Weed tempura, weed ohitashi,

19
00:01:54,310 --> 00:01:57,020
weed pickles, and fried weeds!

20
00:01:57,760 --> 00:01:59,980
Ryo-chan, you really plan to eat that?

21
00:02:00,300 --> 00:02:01,920
You'd better not.

22
00:02:02,520 --> 00:02:03,500
That's right, Ryo-san.

23
00:02:03,820 --> 00:02:06,040
This is all because you
won't lend me any money!

24
00:02:06,700 --> 00:02:10,380
But the Chief ordered us
never to lend you money, right?

25
00:02:10,540 --> 00:02:12,820
Yeah, yeah. You guys are so heartless.

26
00:02:13,300 --> 00:02:16,400
If you won't lend me money,
then don't stand in the way of what I do!

27
00:02:19,020 --> 00:02:21,371
Mm, mm, mm, mm,

28
00:02:21,421 --> 00:02:24,260
This is actually pretty good.

29
00:02:24,260 --> 00:02:26,792
Mm, mm, mm this one,

30
00:02:26,842 --> 00:02:30,020
Wow, senpai, you're really tough.

31
00:02:31,020 --> 00:02:58,020
Uuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuu

32
00:02:58,020 --> 00:03:01,180
Who's the bastard living
it up before his break day?!

33
00:03:01,400 --> 00:03:01,740
Yeah!

34
00:03:05,580 --> 00:03:06,140
Here it is!

35
00:03:06,280 --> 00:03:08,500
Isn't this my room?

36
00:03:11,740 --> 00:03:12,560
Lord Ryo?

37
00:03:12,980 --> 00:03:14,160
Welcome back!

38
00:03:14,540 --> 00:03:17,600
Maria! And it's not even your day off yet!

39
00:03:17,760 --> 00:03:19,220
Where did this sukiyaki come from?

40
00:03:19,540 --> 00:03:22,000
I was planning to eat it
together with Lord Ryo...

41
00:03:22,000 --> 00:03:23,702
Wahoo! A buddha in hell,

42
00:03:23,752 --> 00:03:26,460
no, this is what it means to
have Our Lady Maria in hell!

43
00:03:28,020 --> 00:03:29,080
Well then, Endra-kun.

44
00:03:29,080 --> 00:03:31,320
The meat isn't cooked yet, you know.

45
00:03:31,320 --> 00:03:33,040
Raw is fine too, just eat, eat!

46
00:03:34,260 --> 00:03:34,620
Yes.

47
00:03:35,460 --> 00:03:36,200
Yum!

48
00:03:38,220 --> 00:03:39,160
Nice and mushy.

49
00:03:41,240 --> 00:03:44,640
By the way, what's the sudden visit? Did
they kick you out of the women's dormitory?

50
00:03:45,020 --> 00:03:46,200
No, well, it's just that...

51
00:03:47,100 --> 00:03:51,100
My father found out that I
live in that women's dormitory.

52
00:03:51,640 --> 00:03:52,900
That damn old man found out?

53
00:03:53,620 --> 00:03:53,980
Yes.

54
00:03:54,960 --> 00:03:57,520
You said you wouldn't force me anymore,
didn't you?

55
00:03:58,020 --> 00:04:00,280
You have no choice but
to go through with it.

56
00:04:00,900 --> 00:04:01,980
I absolutely refuse.

57
00:04:03,720 --> 00:04:07,480
Before long, in front of the dormitory,

58
00:04:08,880 --> 00:04:12,560
my father's disciples started
waiting for me to come back,

59
00:04:12,560 --> 00:04:17,240
and eventually my father began coming too.

60
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:19,280
Hey, hey, hey, miss.

61
00:04:19,280 --> 00:04:22,760
There's a place in Odaiba with really good fried rice,
you know.

62
00:04:23,240 --> 00:04:25,820
Wanna come with me? Hm?

63
00:04:27,340 --> 00:04:29,180
I was just thinking I
hadn't seen your face lately.

64
00:04:29,180 --> 00:04:32,600
If things keep going like this,
I'll only cause trouble for everyone,

65
00:04:32,600 --> 00:04:35,060
so I thought I'd ask Ryo-sama to take me in.

66
00:04:36,400 --> 00:04:39,200
With Maria around, we'd save on food money

67
00:04:39,200 --> 00:04:41,220
If that's the situation,
I guess it can't be helped.

68
00:04:41,660 --> 00:04:44,460
Fine, you can stay in this room for a while.

69
00:04:44,960 --> 00:04:45,680
Really?

70
00:04:46,380 --> 00:04:47,100
I'm so happy!

71
00:04:47,100 --> 00:04:49,860
Hey, cut it out, don't cling to me!

72
00:04:49,860 --> 00:04:52,240
I'm so happy to be living with Ryo-sama.

73
00:04:57,820 --> 00:04:59,000
Senpai

74
00:04:59,000 --> 00:05:00,060
Yo, gentlemen

75
00:05:00,060 --> 00:05:01,740
Thanks for your hard work.

76
00:05:02,580 --> 00:05:03,760
Good evening, everyone.

77
00:05:09,260 --> 00:05:11,860
What are you surprised about?
Maria's a man, you know.

78
00:05:12,820 --> 00:05:14,180
Even if you say that...

79
00:05:14,180 --> 00:05:15,460
Even after seeing this?

80
00:05:15,920 --> 00:05:16,320
Hey!

81
00:05:17,980 --> 00:05:18,780
Well...

82
00:05:24,380 --> 00:05:25,020
Senpai.

83
00:05:28,340 --> 00:05:30,280
Anyway, while Maria was in the bath,

84
00:05:30,280 --> 00:05:32,400
Honda and the others
stayed soaking in the tub

85
00:05:32,400 --> 00:05:34,760
and all of them got dizzy
from the heat and passed out.

86
00:05:35,180 --> 00:05:36,380
No wonder, really.

87
00:05:36,380 --> 00:05:38,580
Maria does have a lot of sex appeal,
after all.

88
00:05:38,960 --> 00:05:41,540
Ryo-chan,
you should hurry up and get married!

89
00:05:41,540 --> 00:05:42,580
Don't talk nonsense.

90
00:05:42,580 --> 00:05:44,460
Can two men even get married?

91
00:05:52,780 --> 00:05:53,540
Aaaaaah

92
00:05:56,580 --> 00:05:58,080
Gone

93
00:05:58,080 --> 00:06:02,260
Aaaaaah

94
00:06:02,260 --> 00:06:04,120
Aaaaaah

95
00:06:04,120 --> 00:06:04,560
Aaaaaah

96
00:06:04,560 --> 00:06:06,660
Aaaaaah

97
00:06:06,660 --> 00:06:09,020
Aaaaaah

98
00:06:09,020 --> 00:06:09,680
Aaaaaah

99
00:06:17,840 --> 00:06:20,460
Just as expected, Rin-san, you were perfect.

100
00:06:22,000 --> 00:06:23,420
Thanks, but please don't call me Rin-san.

101
00:06:24,940 --> 00:06:26,720
Marilyn is fine, director.

102
00:06:26,720 --> 00:06:31,920
Marilyn, the Japan location episode of
the new female spy Number Five series?

103
00:06:31,920 --> 00:06:34,100
It'll definitely be a masterpiece.
We're doing it.

104
00:06:34,840 --> 00:06:36,360
I'm looking forward to it, director.

105
00:06:36,360 --> 00:06:37,960
Marilyn, good work today.

106
00:06:39,780 --> 00:06:40,100
Thank you.

107
00:06:40,660 --> 00:06:41,580
By the way, Marilyn,

108
00:06:42,300 --> 00:06:45,780
I hear it'll take about two hours to
get ready for the next scene's shoot,

109
00:06:46,340 --> 00:06:47,500
so there's that much waiting?

110
00:06:47,720 --> 00:06:51,080
What should we do?
Want to rest in the location bus? Or...

111
00:06:53,680 --> 00:06:54,780
Yes, yes, speaking.

112
00:06:55,400 --> 00:06:56,420
May I ask who's calling?

113
00:06:58,680 --> 00:07:01,860
It's a call for Marilyn.
Will you take it? He says he's her father.

114
00:07:03,660 --> 00:07:05,020
Hello, Dad?

115
00:07:05,020 --> 00:07:06,480
I saw you on the talk show.

116
00:07:06,900 --> 00:07:10,480
If you came back to Japan,
why didn't you come home first, Rin?

117
00:07:10,480 --> 00:07:12,000
Papa's sad.

118
00:07:12,000 --> 00:07:15,800
What do you want?
I'm in the middle of filming right now!

119
00:07:15,800 --> 00:07:20,640
That's right, you're the one who'll inherit the
ultimate bookshelf constitution I devised, Rin.

120
00:07:20,640 --> 00:07:25,040
What are you talking about? I'm a woman.
Ai's still around, right, big brother?

121
00:07:25,680 --> 00:07:28,220
But Ai has become a woman.

122
00:07:28,220 --> 00:07:29,520
Big brother...

123
00:07:30,160 --> 00:07:33,180
On top of that, he chased after Gantetsu
and ended up becoming disrespectful.

124
00:07:34,200 --> 00:07:36,120
You're the only one left now.

125
00:07:36,660 --> 00:07:39,380
I understand you don't want to go through this,
but I don't want to either!

126
00:07:39,800 --> 00:07:41,160
Please, you go next.

127
00:07:42,600 --> 00:07:43,860
I'm just going to go see Ai for a bit.

128
00:07:44,280 --> 00:07:44,600
Ai?

129
00:07:44,880 --> 00:07:46,680
Your twin brother?

130
00:07:46,780 --> 00:07:47,100
Yes.

131
00:07:51,500 --> 00:07:54,040
Make sure you come back in two hours.

132
00:07:54,040 --> 00:07:54,620
Okay.

133
00:07:54,620 --> 00:07:55,960
Take this with you.

134
00:07:55,960 --> 00:07:57,040
Thanks, see you.

135
00:07:58,940 --> 00:08:02,440
I'll tell Ai to fulfill his
responsibilities as the eldest son.

136
00:08:05,420 --> 00:08:05,940
Thanks.

137
00:08:07,400 --> 00:08:09,800
Ai said he was staying
in the women's dormitory.

138
00:08:09,800 --> 00:08:12,440
Why on earth did he move
to the men's dormitory?

139
00:08:13,180 --> 00:08:15,120
Welcome home, Ai-chan.

140
00:08:15,120 --> 00:08:17,540
Perfect timing.

141
00:08:17,540 --> 00:08:20,140
Why don't you go take a bath while you can?

142
00:08:20,140 --> 00:08:23,280
Nobody's back yet.

143
00:08:23,280 --> 00:08:25,420
Come on, hurry up.

144
00:08:25,420 --> 00:08:28,140
You don't want to end up
with those guys again, do you?

145
00:08:29,860 --> 00:08:30,900
I see.

146
00:08:31,420 --> 00:08:34,220
So that's why I was mistaken for Ai,
because of how I'm dressed.

147
00:08:35,080 --> 00:08:36,000
Well, never mind.

148
00:08:44,460 --> 00:08:45,780
Maria, I'm home.

149
00:08:47,660 --> 00:08:49,380
She's not back yet?

150
00:08:49,380 --> 00:08:52,000
Welcome home, Ryo-san.

151
00:08:52,000 --> 00:08:53,560
Ai's in the bath.

152
00:08:53,560 --> 00:08:54,240
Bath?

153
00:08:55,500 --> 00:08:56,340
So she is.

154
00:08:57,340 --> 00:08:59,900
Guess I'll take a bath before dinner too.

155
00:09:02,420 --> 00:09:05,020
Right, Maria, I'm getting in too!

156
00:09:07,180 --> 00:09:08,980
Eek! What are you doing?!

157
00:09:09,240 --> 00:09:12,960
Have you completely turned into a woman?

158
00:09:13,360 --> 00:09:14,600
Hey! Your hands!

159
00:09:15,000 --> 00:09:16,660
Ichi! Again!

160
00:09:16,820 --> 00:09:17,760
Ow!

161
00:09:20,400 --> 00:09:22,260
What on earth is going on?

162
00:09:24,680 --> 00:09:27,140
It's your own fault for moving
into the men's dormitory!

163
00:09:27,300 --> 00:09:31,260
Of all people, I had to be seen by a gorilla-like guy like that!
This is the worst!

164
00:09:31,500 --> 00:09:34,900
So this is Ai's room.

165
00:09:35,220 --> 00:09:37,680
Is this Ryotsu's room, or Ai's room?

166
00:09:41,460 --> 00:09:42,440
Aaaaah!

167
00:09:43,460 --> 00:09:46,400
Don't tell me you had
surgery on that chest...

168
00:09:46,400 --> 00:09:49,160
H-hey, what are you doing?!

169
00:09:49,660 --> 00:09:51,340
That's your punishment
for peeking into the bath!

170
00:09:51,860 --> 00:09:54,380
Anyway, do you have a hair dryer?

171
00:10:00,300 --> 00:10:01,400
Hey, I'm starving.

172
00:10:01,800 --> 00:10:03,460
Make dinner once you're done with that.

173
00:10:03,460 --> 00:10:06,100
Why would I make dinner for you?

174
00:10:08,760 --> 00:10:09,880
Something's different from usual.

175
00:10:10,980 --> 00:10:12,440
Hey, where's the bathroom?

176
00:10:12,840 --> 00:10:14,960
Go out into the hall to the
right and it's at the end.

177
00:10:15,260 --> 00:10:15,760
I see.

178
00:10:18,820 --> 00:10:20,780
You should know where
the bathroom is, though.

179
00:10:24,020 --> 00:10:26,060
Ryo-sama, I'm sorry I'm late.

180
00:10:26,060 --> 00:10:28,220
I'll start making dinner right away.

181
00:10:28,220 --> 00:10:35,800
You just said you wouldn't!

182
00:10:36,480 --> 00:10:37,720
I don't want to, Ryo-sama.

183
00:10:38,340 --> 00:10:40,800
I make meals for you, Ryo-sama,

184
00:10:40,800 --> 00:10:42,720
and I love doing your laundry.

185
00:10:42,720 --> 00:10:44,780
I would never say such a thing.

186
00:10:45,800 --> 00:10:46,160
That's right.

187
00:10:47,740 --> 00:10:48,220
That's right.

188
00:10:50,280 --> 00:10:51,200
Hey, Maria.

189
00:10:51,200 --> 00:10:51,940
Yes?

190
00:10:52,700 --> 00:10:54,860
About your chest there...

191
00:10:54,860 --> 00:10:57,340
What about my chest?

192
00:10:57,340 --> 00:10:58,840
Well

193
00:11:00,060 --> 00:11:01,160
Mind if I touch it?

194
00:11:01,160 --> 00:11:03,860
That's no trouble at all.

195
00:11:03,860 --> 00:11:06,000
It's just padding inside, but go ahead.

196
00:11:06,000 --> 00:11:07,300
Well then, just a little...

197
00:11:10,760 --> 00:11:11,960
No, you can't.

198
00:11:11,960 --> 00:11:13,960
I forgot to buy soy sauce.

199
00:11:13,960 --> 00:11:16,080
Just a moment,
I'll borrow some from Ryo's aunt.

200
00:11:21,180 --> 00:11:24,300
Now that you've actually said go ahead,
it's hard to touch.

201
00:11:27,860 --> 00:11:30,340
That was quick. Well then.

202
00:11:30,860 --> 00:11:32,160
W-why would you do that!

203
00:11:32,800 --> 00:11:35,640
Ow! Hey, you said I could touch it.

204
00:11:38,980 --> 00:11:39,780
Rin!

205
00:11:40,940 --> 00:11:41,560
Ai?

206
00:11:42,560 --> 00:11:45,500
What the...! Why are there two Marias?

207
00:12:01,960 --> 00:12:03,440
She looks just like me!

208
00:12:03,760 --> 00:12:04,960
W-what's going on here?

209
00:12:05,460 --> 00:12:08,398
Ryo-sama, Rin is my twin sister.

210
00:12:08,448 --> 00:12:10,440
She's an actress in Hong Kong.

211
00:12:10,960 --> 00:12:14,960
A twin sister!
So that's why those were real boobs.

212
00:12:15,100 --> 00:12:17,794
Rin, what are you doing here?

213
00:12:17,844 --> 00:12:20,300
I'm in Tokyo right now
for a film location shoot.

214
00:12:20,780 --> 00:12:22,602
I came here hoping to see you, and

215
00:12:22,652 --> 00:12:24,900
this guy peeked into the
bath and groped my chest.

216
00:12:25,180 --> 00:12:26,980
I'm so mad!

217
00:12:27,400 --> 00:12:30,560
Hey, what else could I do! I didn't know!

218
00:12:31,180 --> 00:12:34,241
A-anyway, now that you two are
standing side by side like that,

219
00:12:34,291 --> 00:12:36,320
you look like clones.

220
00:12:36,320 --> 00:12:38,840
Seriously,
you even copied each other's hairstyles.

221
00:12:39,420 --> 00:12:41,000
Why did you turn into a woman?!

222
00:12:41,900 --> 00:12:45,040
Well... Dad called, you know.

223
00:12:45,500 --> 00:12:49,180
What am I supposed to do if they make me
the head of that creepy Honji Kenko outfit?!

224
00:12:49,440 --> 00:12:51,500
I hate that octopus-dance nonsense.

225
00:12:51,780 --> 00:12:53,060
You should take over Ringer.

226
00:12:53,540 --> 00:12:55,160
I'm an actress, you know.

227
00:12:55,360 --> 00:12:57,320
You can do it while acting, can't you?

228
00:12:57,540 --> 00:12:59,260
You do it while managing the business.

229
00:12:59,620 --> 00:13:01,580
What?! You're the eldest son!

230
00:13:02,000 --> 00:13:02,800
That's none of my business!

231
00:13:03,220 --> 00:13:05,620
Hey, hey, stop fighting, you two.

232
00:13:06,120 --> 00:13:08,960
Don't tell me you seduced Ai?

233
00:13:09,160 --> 00:13:12,020
You're the eldest son
who turned Ai into a woman.

234
00:13:12,260 --> 00:13:13,020
N-no, it's not like that!

235
00:13:13,300 --> 00:13:14,620
Lord Ryo, I've given up on the double-stick!

236
00:13:15,980 --> 00:13:16,820
You did it now!

237
00:13:17,180 --> 00:13:17,960
Hyah!

238
00:13:19,520 --> 00:13:21,020
Don't copy my voice!

239
00:13:21,100 --> 00:13:22,640
Talk like a real man, for once!

240
00:13:23,060 --> 00:13:25,180
I can't fix it now! It's too late!

241
00:13:25,600 --> 00:13:26,760
Wait, you two!

242
00:13:27,000 --> 00:13:28,420
Don't fight with the same voice!

243
00:13:28,720 --> 00:13:29,420
You're making a mess of things!

244
00:13:29,740 --> 00:13:30,700
Maria, calm down too!

245
00:13:30,700 --> 00:13:32,640
I'm Rin, and that one's Ai.

246
00:13:32,640 --> 00:13:33,898
I see.

247
00:13:33,948 --> 00:13:36,940
I can't believe that stubbornness
belongs to a younger sister.

248
00:13:38,920 --> 00:13:39,860
Yes, I'm Rin.

249
00:13:41,140 --> 00:13:42,460
Is it already that late?

250
00:13:42,680 --> 00:13:45,100
Ai, we'll settle this after
the location shoot is over.

251
00:13:45,100 --> 00:13:47,500
Fine by me, I was counting on it.

252
00:13:51,680 --> 00:13:53,640
Honey, the cookies are ready.

253
00:13:54,160 --> 00:13:55,640
Try a bite, won't you?

254
00:13:55,640 --> 00:13:57,140
Isn't that Rin-chan?

255
00:13:58,120 --> 00:14:02,780
Marilyn Asatorin, the Japanese-born
star who became a hit in Hong Kong,

256
00:14:02,780 --> 00:14:04,740
has come to Japan to
shoot a movie on location.

257
00:14:05,240 --> 00:14:08,000
How are you? Back in Japan after so long...

258
00:14:08,000 --> 00:14:09,660
Dad!

259
00:14:10,560 --> 00:14:11,060
What?

260
00:14:11,380 --> 00:14:15,760
I am absolutely not learning
bookshelf swordsmanship!

261
00:14:16,780 --> 00:14:17,640
Hrk... hrk...

262
00:14:17,640 --> 00:14:19,360
Why, Rin!

263
00:14:20,140 --> 00:14:22,240
Brother! I'm going to go see Rin!

264
00:14:23,520 --> 00:14:26,060
Darling!

265
00:14:27,700 --> 00:14:31,680
Oh my, you two really are
Marilyn's spitting image!

266
00:14:31,680 --> 00:14:34,460
That's right, but I'm a man, you know.

267
00:14:34,980 --> 00:14:38,720
I'm sure my tomboyish sister has been a terrible handful for you,
but

268
00:14:38,720 --> 00:14:40,720
please look after her.

269
00:14:40,720 --> 00:14:42,400
No, not at all. Thank you.

270
00:14:42,400 --> 00:14:45,380
Come on, Director, let's start shooting!

271
00:14:48,800 --> 00:14:50,200
Come on, come on, come on!

272
00:14:51,900 --> 00:14:56,660
He comes at me like this,
so I dodge like this and kick back.

273
00:14:59,540 --> 00:15:02,980
No wonder she's a popular actress.
The staff are really looking out for her.

274
00:15:02,980 --> 00:15:04,400
Rin's just so selfish.

275
00:15:04,800 --> 00:15:07,220
Alright, let's try a rehearsal.

276
00:15:07,600 --> 00:15:10,100
Ladies, action!

277
00:15:18,200 --> 00:15:19,540
What's wrong, Marilyn?

278
00:15:19,540 --> 00:15:23,740
Look what you did! Your timing was so bad,
you twisted my ankle!

279
00:15:24,800 --> 00:15:25,580
Sorry.

280
00:15:27,520 --> 00:15:27,660
I'm not coming!

281
00:15:28,520 --> 00:15:29,000
Kishima!

282
00:15:29,420 --> 00:15:29,740
Yes!

283
00:15:29,940 --> 00:15:30,800
Bring a chair.

284
00:15:30,800 --> 00:15:31,360
Yes.

285
00:15:32,900 --> 00:15:35,520
Her selfishness really
shows she's a popular actress

286
00:15:35,960 --> 00:15:39,060
Once Rin starts throwing a tantrum,
she won't listen to anything you say.

287
00:15:39,640 --> 00:15:41,680
Hey, Marilyn, is there really no way?

288
00:15:42,080 --> 00:15:43,940
My ankle hurts, so there's nothing I can do.

289
00:15:44,420 --> 00:15:45,960
Then after resting for a little while,

290
00:15:46,840 --> 00:15:50,860
What? Are you, my manager,
trying to make me push through this too?

291
00:15:51,760 --> 00:15:52,920
I really can't believe this.

292
00:15:52,920 --> 00:15:55,240
This is hopeless.

293
00:15:55,240 --> 00:15:58,780
Oh no, this is a problem, Al.
What should we do?

294
00:16:03,240 --> 00:16:04,780
That's right, Al. You.

295
00:16:05,760 --> 00:16:07,660
Please, would you be Marilyn's stand-in?

296
00:16:08,760 --> 00:16:12,320
Don't worry, don't worry.
There are no lines. It's just action.

297
00:16:13,140 --> 00:16:14,780
No, that's impossible for me.

298
00:16:15,080 --> 00:16:15,500
Ai.

299
00:16:16,500 --> 00:16:18,340
If you'll be my stand-in,

300
00:16:18,390 --> 00:16:21,880
I'll take on the grand master
of Honda Rakken's story for you.

301
00:16:22,720 --> 00:16:24,280
Really? Alright, I'll do it.

302
00:16:25,240 --> 00:16:26,240
Will you do it?

303
00:16:26,440 --> 00:16:27,380
Good luck.

304
00:16:28,040 --> 00:16:28,480
Yeah.

305
00:16:28,480 --> 00:16:30,400
Alright, let's resume filming.

306
00:16:30,880 --> 00:16:32,480
Let's go for the take.

307
00:16:35,200 --> 00:16:37,880
Hey, you're quite the reasonable one,
aren't you?

308
00:16:37,880 --> 00:16:38,860
As if!

309
00:16:39,080 --> 00:16:41,520
She'll do anything if you
just say the right thing.

310
00:16:41,520 --> 00:16:44,400
Her cunning rivals that of a top actress,
this is.

311
00:16:44,960 --> 00:16:46,380
Ladies!

312
00:16:46,380 --> 00:16:48,080
Action!

313
00:16:48,100 --> 00:16:48,960
Whoa!

314
00:16:48,960 --> 00:17:13,700
!

315
00:17:13,700 --> 00:17:15,320
This one's useless now, aru ne.

316
00:17:15,860 --> 00:17:16,893
What should we do,

317
00:17:16,943 --> 00:17:20,040
I got carried away and went all out,
I'm sorry.

318
00:17:23,640 --> 00:17:26,160
You! What about those
three auto-rickshaw drivers?!

319
00:17:35,240 --> 00:17:36,420
Father.

320
00:17:37,260 --> 00:17:40,440
Please, the bookshelf swordsmanship,
there's no choice but to have you inherit it.

321
00:17:41,840 --> 00:17:42,640
What is this?

322
00:17:44,900 --> 00:17:47,440
No way, Father. That's a bad idea.

323
00:17:47,580 --> 00:17:48,520
What?

324
00:17:49,760 --> 00:17:52,400
What happened to those bouncy,
jiggly F-cups?

325
00:17:52,660 --> 00:17:53,540
Dad.

326
00:17:54,160 --> 00:17:56,120
That one's Ai, and I'm this one over here.

327
00:17:59,560 --> 00:18:01,780
Sorry, they look so alike I got confused.

328
00:18:02,220 --> 00:18:04,600
My F-cup is weird like this, see?

329
00:18:04,840 --> 00:18:06,000
Let's see.

330
00:18:08,260 --> 00:18:09,640
As if I'd let you touch them, right?

331
00:18:10,840 --> 00:18:12,640
You're still a lecherous old perv

332
00:18:15,060 --> 00:18:17,120
Ryotsu, you bastard,
what are you doing here?

333
00:18:17,840 --> 00:18:20,100
You're not seriously messing with Rin too,
are you?

334
00:18:20,460 --> 00:18:22,920
I'm just watching the shoot.

335
00:18:23,280 --> 00:18:25,100
Then get your act together
and get out of here!

336
00:18:25,440 --> 00:18:27,720
Father, that's rude to Ryo-sama!

337
00:18:28,120 --> 00:18:29,420
Shut up, you stupid son!

338
00:18:30,040 --> 00:18:32,060
Letting some perverted gorilla
like this lead you astray!

339
00:18:32,280 --> 00:18:32,840
Shut up!

340
00:18:33,300 --> 00:18:35,220
Coming from a lecherous old geezer like you!

341
00:18:36,540 --> 00:18:37,460
Listen here, Ryotsu.

342
00:18:37,960 --> 00:18:40,040
Lay one finger on my
successor and see what happens!

343
00:18:40,440 --> 00:18:41,560
You won't get off easy!

344
00:18:44,700 --> 00:18:45,800
Then who's the heir!

345
00:18:47,300 --> 00:18:49,420
Ai won't inherit it,
so there's no one but you left!

346
00:18:49,960 --> 00:18:52,300
Don't be ridiculous! I absolutely refuse!

347
00:18:53,080 --> 00:18:55,100
Then who's going to inherit
the bookshelf swordsmanship!

348
00:18:55,880 --> 00:18:57,560
Of course it's the eldest son, Ai!

349
00:18:58,040 --> 00:19:01,660
I'm going to be happy with Ryo-sama,
so I absolutely refuse!

350
00:19:02,720 --> 00:19:05,700
I'm going to become a
world-famous actress too, so

351
00:19:05,750 --> 00:19:06,820
I absolutely, positively refuse!

352
00:19:07,820 --> 00:19:10,300
I absolutely, positively,
definitely refuse too!

353
00:19:10,300 --> 00:19:13,690
Fine! I swore I wouldn't say this, but

354
00:19:13,740 --> 00:19:15,460
Ai, I'm going to say it straight out!

355
00:19:15,980 --> 00:19:16,800
What?

356
00:19:19,760 --> 00:19:20,400
Right?

357
00:19:21,040 --> 00:19:24,400
Of all people, falling for a
gorilla-like man like him is just wrong!

358
00:19:25,080 --> 00:19:28,577
What did you say?
I could put up with you insulting me,

359
00:19:28,627 --> 00:19:31,040
but I can't forgive
insults aimed at Ryo-sama!

360
00:19:31,580 --> 00:19:36,840
Are you an idiot? You're a man, aren't you?
No matter how much you love him, you can't possibly marry him!

361
00:19:37,040 --> 00:19:39,560
Just give up already and become Dad's heir!

362
00:19:40,300 --> 00:19:40,940
I can't forgive this!

363
00:19:49,500 --> 00:19:50,500
You did it!

364
00:19:52,280 --> 00:19:56,440
Things took an unexpected turn.

365
00:19:56,740 --> 00:19:58,300
No, this is a good chance.

366
00:19:58,620 --> 00:20:00,584
Yes, Rin, listen carefully.

367
00:20:00,634 --> 00:20:04,160
Whoever loses this fight will become
the heir to the bookshelf swordsmanship.

368
00:20:05,400 --> 00:20:06,320
What did you say?

369
00:20:06,860 --> 00:20:09,380
Hey, wouldn't the winner
normally be the one who inherits?

370
00:20:10,300 --> 00:20:12,800
Shut up! That way there won't be any hard feelings,
will there!

371
00:20:13,180 --> 00:20:15,540
Fine! Ai, I'm going all out!

372
00:20:16,320 --> 00:20:17,080
It's a showdown!

373
00:20:23,240 --> 00:20:24,440
Amazing, it's too amazing!

374
00:20:25,260 --> 00:20:26,680
Hey! Roll the camera!

375
00:20:26,920 --> 00:20:28,760
But we haven't finished filming yet...

376
00:20:28,760 --> 00:20:33,120
Never mind! A battle this spectacular
is something you rarely get to see!

377
00:20:33,620 --> 00:20:33,940
Yes!

378
00:20:37,060 --> 00:20:40,240
It's settled,
then: Number Five versus the clone human!

379
00:20:41,180 --> 00:20:42,560
No, no, no!

380
00:20:42,940 --> 00:20:43,620
Help!

381
00:20:49,240 --> 00:20:52,323
So in the end,
a man's love is stronger, is it?

382
00:20:52,373 --> 00:20:53,940
Strength... and the heir is...

383
00:20:54,100 --> 00:20:55,540
Place your bets, place your bets!

384
00:20:57,200 --> 00:20:58,540
A thousand yen each.

385
00:20:58,980 --> 00:20:59,900
This one's Marilyn.

386
00:21:00,200 --> 00:21:02,560
This is the big sis...
no, the big bro's side.

387
00:21:02,920 --> 00:21:05,640
That guy,
turning this sacred battle into a circus.

388
00:21:07,340 --> 00:21:09,040
Hehehehehe.

389
00:21:09,040 --> 00:21:10,760
Pass, or no other choice? No other choice?

390
00:21:11,900 --> 00:21:12,300
Hey.

391
00:21:12,300 --> 00:21:14,700
I'm putting a million on Rin.

392
00:21:14,700 --> 00:21:16,160
Don't you dare bet on it.

393
00:21:16,160 --> 00:21:17,920
Alright, I've placed my bet, so there.

394
00:21:23,060 --> 00:21:26,680
Lord Ryo

395
00:21:27,960 --> 00:21:28,760
What's that?

396
00:21:28,760 --> 00:21:30,280
Try moving even a little.

397
00:21:30,280 --> 00:21:32,460
I'll crush this guy's balls.

398
00:21:33,580 --> 00:21:34,880
Father, stop it!

399
00:21:34,880 --> 00:21:38,560
-Ow!-Rin, Ai's rattled.
Take advantage of this chance and beat her!

400
00:21:38,640 --> 00:21:41,200
-You bastard, you're dead!-Shut up!

401
00:21:41,340 --> 00:21:43,716
Ai, I'm sorry, but I

402
00:21:43,766 --> 00:21:47,540
want to keep acting! Sorry!

403
00:21:49,380 --> 00:21:50,580
Stop it!

404
00:21:57,720 --> 00:22:01,160
-Rin, what on earth are you doing?-W-well,
this is...

405
00:22:01,160 --> 00:22:01,383
this hand,

406
00:22:01,433 --> 00:22:25,180
let go!!!

407
00:22:25,180 --> 00:22:27,860
But then who will inherit
the bookshelf swordsmanship?!

408
00:22:28,800 --> 00:22:31,010
If you want your own child
to inherit it so badly,

409
00:22:31,060 --> 00:22:33,320
why don't you just make another child?

410
00:22:35,320 --> 00:22:36,440
Now there's an idea!

411
00:22:37,960 --> 00:22:39,780
Let's make one right away, my honey!

412
00:22:47,700 --> 00:22:48,360
What did you say?

413
00:22:48,720 --> 00:22:52,200
Don't you dare belittle the
world's strongest bookshelf sword!

414
00:22:56,080 --> 00:22:58,920
Damn it! You actually did it,
you perverted old kappa!

415
00:22:59,360 --> 00:23:00,520
What a pervert you are!

416
00:23:03,960 --> 00:23:07,360
Ryo-san. It's like a children's squabble.

417
00:23:07,620 --> 00:23:09,308
Ai-chan, Rin-chan.

418
00:23:09,358 --> 00:23:12,400
One bookshelf sword is plenty for us,
darling.

419
00:23:12,480 --> 00:23:14,980
Really? Just like Mom!

420
00:23:14,980 --> 00:23:17,740
Well, then there's no need for us to fight,
is there?

421
00:23:18,060 --> 00:23:18,380
Mm.

422
00:23:18,840 --> 00:23:20,960
Ai, I'm sorry for saying such awful things.

423
00:23:21,100 --> 00:23:22,700
No, I'm sorry too.

424
00:23:23,280 --> 00:23:26,640
Well, it's been ages, so let's have
a meal together, just the three of us.

425
00:23:26,780 --> 00:23:27,760
Yes, Mom.

426
00:23:27,940 --> 00:23:29,380
Let's go, let's go.

427
00:23:29,460 --> 00:23:30,140
Ai, Rin.

428
00:23:31,180 --> 00:23:32,980
Otarake, ear pull!

429
00:23:33,780 --> 00:23:35,080
Ear pull, counter!

430
00:23:36,400 --> 00:23:38,980
Spittle dance, spittle dance counter!

431
00:23:39,660 --> 00:23:40,900
Otama, bite!

432
00:23:41,140 --> 00:23:42,300
Bite, counter!

433
00:23:43,380 --> 00:23:45,100
This is terrible, way too terrible.

434
00:23:45,520 --> 00:23:48,580
Director, what should we do?
We're waiting on the film.

435
00:23:49,100 --> 00:23:52,020
Stop, stop, this fight is rotting my eyes.

436
00:23:52,020 --> 00:23:52,880
Wrap it up.

437
00:23:55,260 --> 00:23:56,400
Eogapper!

438
00:23:57,040 --> 00:23:58,300
Gorilla Rangers!

439
00:23:58,300 --> 00:23:59,340
Gorilla Rangers!

440
00:24:03,620 --> 00:24:06,920
What? The Chief's being transferred
to the 3-chome shooting range?

441
00:24:07,120 --> 00:24:09,380
Yes! Super, super lucky!

442
00:24:09,380 --> 00:24:11,900
Now we won't have to look at

443
00:24:11,900 --> 00:24:13,520
that stubborn old man's
grumpy face every day anymore.

444
00:24:13,520 --> 00:24:15,980
Now it's time to relax
while the ogre's away!

445
00:24:15,980 --> 00:24:17,900
Time to build some plastic models!

446
00:24:18,380 --> 00:24:21,360
Next time:
"Farewell, Chief Ohara." See you then!

447
00:24:31,200 --> 00:24:37,140
People gossip that I'm a
woman who can't fall in love,

448
00:24:37,140 --> 00:24:43,000
but I have mountains of things I want to do.

449
00:24:44,660 --> 00:24:52,040
I want to ride a motorbike
across the vast desert.

450
00:24:52,040 --> 00:24:59,320
I want to be freer than a bird.

451
00:24:59,320 --> 00:25:07,140
At the speed of a kaleidoscope,
the lady's dreams keep changing.

452
00:25:09,180 --> 00:25:15,100
Heart of love, sorry, I lose.

453
00:25:15,100 --> 00:25:22,240
Diving into a panoramic future, so dazzling.

454
00:25:23,500 --> 00:25:30,080
You understand, right?
Sorry, just wait for me.

